stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Started: Popen
  Started --> EarlyExit: ended within start_window
  Started --> Running: alive after start_window
  Running --> Closed: user closes window (exit 0)
  Running --> Crashed: exit code != 0
  Running --> Terminated: close_all() (SIGTERM / SIGKILL)
  EarlyExit --> [*]: classified ERROR -> keep
  Crashed --> [*]: classified ERROR -> keep
  Closed --> [*]: classified CLOSED -> remove after confirmation
  Terminated --> [*]: classified OPEN -> keep, add to kept list
